#%RAML 1.0 DataType
(package): Agent
displayName: AgentResponsesOutputType
type: string
description: |
  Entity that the Intake Agent creates from a [/responses](/api/agents/intake-agent#create-a-cart-or-quote-request) request. Never inferred from the input.
enum:
  - Cart
  - QuoteRequest
(enumDescriptions):
  Cart: |
    Create a [Cart](ctp:api:type:Cart).
  QuoteRequest: |
    Create a [QuoteRequest](ctp:api:type:QuoteRequest). Requires a verified [Customer](ctp:api:type:Customer), identified by email.
